    <div style="line-height: 1.25;">Haifa, Israel, August 19, 2026 &#8211; <u>ZIM Integrated Shipping Services Ltd.</u> (NYSE: ZIM) (&#8220;ZIM&#8221; or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) announced today its consolidated results for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026.</div>
    <div style="line-height: 1.25;"><br style="line-height: 1.25;">
    </div>
    <div style="line-height: 1.25;">ZIM&#8217;s strong second-quarter results demonstrated the resilience of its business. ZIM&#8217;s strategic presence in the Transpacific trade enabled the Company to capitalize on favorable market conditions, which together with
      ZIM&#8217;s modern, fuel-efficient and cost-effective fleet and agile commercial strategy, drove improved year-over-year profitability.</div>
